{"hw":"ταὐτός","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ταὐτός</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ταὐτός</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ή</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">όν</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">identical</b>, in nom. pl. masc. <span class=\"gk\">ταὐτοί</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Syrian.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">in Metaph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">137.22</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">25</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">26</span> </span>, Sch. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Theoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.56</span> </span> codd.; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ ταὐτό</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Metaph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1054b15</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ ταὐτόν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Syrian.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">in Metaph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">62.32</span> </span>, al.</div></div>"}